    "detailed_description": "<h1>Vulpis Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Guide a lonely fox through a vast interconnected world of a mysterious planet Vulpis in this Metroidvania-style game. Explore non-linear paths, unlock new abilities, fight enemies, overcome obstacles, and unravel the planet's mysteries to find a way back home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic Metroidvania-style gameplay<br></li><li>Vast interconnected world<br></li><li>Non-linear exploration<br></li><li>Hidden secrets and collectibles<br></li><li>Unlockable abilities and power-ups<br></li><li>Unique boss fights and enemies<br></li><li>Challenging combat and platforming mechanics<br></li><li>Atmospheric and mysterious setting<br></li><li>Immersive lore-driven storyline<br></li><li>Multiple endings<br></li><li>Retro-inspired pixel art graphics</li></ul>",
